entityDescription:
Mazarom Impex srl was established in 1992. 
The company's main object of activity is related to CNC machine tool services. 
Mazarom can provide the following services:
- Design and development for mechanical parts;
- High precision CNC machining;
- Surface chemical treatment of aluminum (sulfuric anodizing and hard anodizing);
- CNC machine tools related services as:
&bull; Development of CNC technological programs;

&bull; Execution of models for mechanical parts;
&bull; Technical applications;

&bull; Programming and operating training for CNC machines; 
&bull; CNC machines installation and service.

